[2026-09-28T17:47:32.782+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1] 
[2026-09-28T17:47:32.782+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1] 1. Treat the current node as owning the smallest executable feature slice required by its scenarios.
[2026-09-28T17:47:32.782+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1] 2. Design only interfaces needed for the owned chain, which may span UI -> API -> FUNC -> DB when those layers are truly owned by the leaf.
