[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       "specification": "Uses the shared axios instance from frontend/src/api/index.ts (baseURL '/api') so global request/response interceptors and error handling apply; no page may call axios directly. Exports AuthUser { id, username, email, emailVerified }, RegisterPayload { username, email, password, confirmPassword, agreeToTerms }, RegisterField, RegisterErrorCode, RegisterFieldError { field, code }, RegisterResult { ok, user?, errors }, SignInPayload/SignInResult, SessionResult. Endpoint wrappers: registerAccount(payload) -> POST /api/auth/register returning { ok, user?, errors: RegisterFieldError[] }; signInWithPassword({ identifier, password }) -> POST /api/auth/signin; fetchSession() -> GET /api/auth/session returning { user: AuthUser | null }; signOutSession() -> POST /api/auth/signout. REGISTER_FIELD_MESSAGES supplies the exact user-visible strings ('Username already exists', 'Username format is invalid', 'Email exists'/'Email format is invalid', 'Password requirements are not satisfied', 'Passwords do not match', 'Agree to terms is required') and REGISTER_ERROR_FIELDS maps each code to its owning field so multiple messages can render simultaneously. The register response must never include the password. TODO for TDD: confirm error payload shapes against the implemented route and add the axios interceptor contract if the shared instance still lacks it.",
[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       "inputs": [
[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]         "RegisterPayload from RegisterPage",
[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]         "credentials/identifier from SignInPage"
[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       ],
[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       "outputs": [
[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]         "RegisterResult, SignInResult, SessionResult typed responses",
[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]         "REGISTER_FIELD_MESSAGES / REGISTER_ERROR_FIELDS rendering maps"
[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       ],
[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       "callers": [
