[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       "specification": "Express router mounted at /api/auth. POST /register body { username, email, password, confirmPassword, agreeToTerms } -> 201 { ok: true, user: { id, username, email, emailVerified: true }, errors: [] } and establishes the session (registration alone must produce a sign-in-capable account whose email is already verified, with no verification page or token step); 400 { ok: false, user: null, errors: [{ field, code }] } lists every violated rule from one submission so the UI can show username, email, password and terms messages together. Conflict codes: USERNAME_EXISTS -> username, EMAIL_EXISTS -> email (detected in addition to format errors). POST /signin body { identifier, password } where identifier is a username or a registered email -> 200 { ok: true, user } + session, else 401 { ok: false, user: null, message }. GET /session -> 200 { user: AuthUser | null } based on durable session state, used for reload recovery. POST /signout -> 200 { ok: true } and clears session state. Responses must never include password or password_hash. TODO for TDD: replace the placeholder session middleware expectation (req.session installed in backend/src/app.js) with the chosen durable session store, and ensure the JSON error codes stay stable for the frontend maps.",
[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       "inputs": [
[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]         "JSON request bodies from the frontend auth client",
[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]         "session cookie from the browser"
[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       ],
[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       "outputs": [
[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]         "201/400 register responses with aggregated { field, code } errors and never any password data",
[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]         "200/401 sign-in responses, 200 session snapshot, 200 sign-out"
[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       ],
