[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       "specification": "backend/src/app.js now requires ./routes/auth_routes and mounts it with app.use('/api/auth', authRoutes) before the static/SPA fallback so API routes are never shadowed by index.html. The session middleware is intentionally not yet installed: TestDrivenDeveloper must add a durable session implementation (cookie-based express-session with a persistent store, or equivalent) via app.use(...) so registration and sign-in state survives reload and GET /api/auth/session returns the current user; the session cookie must be httpOnly and consistent with the sign-out handler. Keep this file to middleware + mounting only; no validation or persistence logic belongs here.",
