[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]         "incoming HTTP requests under /api/auth",
[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]         "session cookie from the browser"
[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       ],
