[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       "responsibility": "Validation, conflict detection, account creation with immediate verified-email status, and credential verification for username or email sign-in.",
[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       "specification": "collectFieldErrors(payload) enforces every rule in one pass and returns all violations (never short-circuiting only the first): username must match /^[a-z0-9]+(?:-[a-z0-9]+)*$/ with length 1..39 and no leading/trailing hyphen (USERNAME_INVALID); email is trimmed of leading/trailing whitespace, must be <= 254 chars, contain exactly one '@', and have a dotted non-empty domain with non-empty labels after '@' (EMAIL_INVALID); password must be 12..128 chars with at least one uppercase, one lowercase, one digit, and one non-alphanumeric character and no whitespace (PASSWORD_INVALID); confirmPassword mismatch -> CONFIRM_MISMATCH; agreeToTerms !== true -> TERMS_REQUIRED. registerAccount(payload) adds conflict checks (USERNAME_EXISTS, EMAIL_EXISTS) and, only when no format/terms/mismatch errors remain, inserts the account inside withTransaction with email_verified = 1 and a salted scrypt hash, returning the public { id, username, email, emailVerified: true } shape. authenticate(identifier, password) resolves the account by email first then username, compares scrypt hashes, and returns { ok, user } or { ok: false, message }. No password or hash ever leaves this module. TODO for TDD: verify the aggregated-error contract with supertest, decide whether email conflict is reported alongside username conflict, and keep the scrypt comparison timing-safe.",
[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       "inputs": [
[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]         "{ username, email, password, confirmPassword, agreeToTerms } from the register route",
[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]         "{ identifier, password } from the sign-in route"
[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       ],
[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       "outputs": [
[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]         "{ ok: true, user } or { ok: false, errors: [{ field, code }] } from registerAccount",
[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]         "{ ok, user | message } from authenticate",
[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]         "aggregated collectFieldErrors result for reuse and unit tests"
[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]       ],
