[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]         "multiple violations returned in one call",
[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]         "created account is sign-in capable and has email_verified true",
[2026-09-28T17:52:18.972+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1]         "no account row is created for any rejected submission"
