[2026-09-28T17:52:23.571+08:00] [TestGenerator][REQ-1-1-1] 4. Prefer existing shell/header/provider/client/server/database boundaries before creating new owners.
[2026-09-28T17:52:23.571+08:00] [TestGenerator][REQ-1-1-1] 5. A registration or login success should update global authenticated state and expose a durable session recovery path.
